{"ID":"20240504154555-ncxboqq","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504154555-ncxboqq","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504154555-ncxboqq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240618173729-nz10tnc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607111716-2zmwrb0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240616110522-52fgnv6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"045白蒿","type":"doc","updated":"20240805162032"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240805153805-opsmr8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240805153805-opsmr8n","updated":"20240805153805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206110032-mpd4o4w.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240805153805-bnv7kx1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240805153805-bnv7kx1","updated":"20240805153805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 661px;","style":"width: 651px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"茵陈蒿"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/茵陈蒿-20240205161435-uf2kzj0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 651px;\" parent-style=\"width: 661px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240618171428-pe2dz4t.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240805161627-kdlenkg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240805161627-kdlenkg","updated":"20240805161635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 629px;","style":"width: 619px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蒿 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蒿 6-20240805161627-89umsa4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 619px;\" parent-style=\"width: 629px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 566px;","style":"width: 556px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蒿 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蒿 5-20240805161525-b4t8md0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 556px;\" parent-style=\"width: 566px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240805145214-rj03a1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240805145214-rj03a1k","updated":"20240805161449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 614px;","style":"width: 604px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240618165843-bp6h6cr.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 604px;\" parent-style=\"width: 614px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 654px;","style":"width: 644px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蒿"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蒿-20240805161058-62mdu50.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 644px;\" parent-style=\"width: 654px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240805161434-y0x5877","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240805161434-y0x5877","updated":"20240805161437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 504px;","style":"width: 494px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蒿 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蒿 4-20240805161437-8sywbsr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 494px;\" parent-style=\"width: 504px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蒿 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蒿 3-20240805161434-rlv3wxe.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240805161148-a01kvjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240805161148-a01kvjk","updated":"20240805162032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 557px;","style":"width: 547px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蒿 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蒿 1-20240805161255-52qkz4b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 547px;\" parent-style=\"width: 557px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 557px;","style":"width: 547px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蒿 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蒿 2-20240805161243-9so7qcx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 547px;\" parent-style=\"width: 557px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240805143504-tmbhons","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240805143504-tmbhons","updated":"20240805154709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：关于白蒿跟茵陈网络说法不一，有说白蒿跟茵陈是同一株植物（取自‘三月茵陈四月蒿，五月六月当柴烧’的顺口溜），也有说白蒿跟茵陈不是同一株植物，说法是真正的茵陈是开黄色花朵；目前觉得抖音创作者“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"嵩山采药人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"”说法，与神农本草经的性味记载较为匹配，故该白蒿取图为‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"毛茵陈"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"’，以下附上视频；另点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240205153745-34q9rne","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"077茵陈（茵陈蒿、黄花茵陈、角茴香）"}]},{"ID":"20240805150107-opl5lnw","Type":"NodeVideo","Data":"\u003cvideo controls=\"controls\" src=\"assets/茵陈蒿纠正-20240805150107-3p0q5w7.mp4\" data-src=\"assets/茵陈蒿纠正-20240805150107-3p0q5w7.mp4\"\u003e\u003c/video\u003e","Properties":{"id":"20240805150107-opl5lnw","updated":"20240805150107"}},{"ID":"20240607111722-zocj9u8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607111722-zocj9u8"}},{"ID":"20240616110522-t3iim6w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616110522-t3iim6w","updated":"20240616110525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白蒿《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616110522-52fgnv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110522-52fgnv6","updated":"20240616110522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘平。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110522-win1hij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110522-win1hij","updated":"20240616110522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主五脏邪气，风寒温痹，补中益气，长毛发，令黑，疗心悬，少食，常饥。久服，轻身，耳目聪明，不老。生川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110522-ppdnx17","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110522-ppdnx17","updated":"20240616110522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生中山，二月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110522-hjbn6ov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110522-hjbn6ov","updated":"20240616110522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：蘩，白蒿也，艾，冰台也；《广雅》云：蘩，母，蒡葧也；《尔雅》云：艾，冰台；郭璞云：今艾，白蒿；《夏小正》云：二月采蘩；《传》云：蘩，由胡，由胡者，繁母也，繁母者，旁勃也；《尔雅》云：蘩，皤蒿；郭璞云：白蒿，又蘩，由胡；郭璞云：未详；《毛诗》云：于以采蘩，《传》云蘩，皤蒿也，又采蘩祁祁；《传》云：蘩，白蒿也；陆玑云：凡艾，白色者为皤蒿；《楚词》王逸注云：艾，白蒿也，按皤白，音义皆相近，艾，是药名，《本草经》无者，即白蒿是也，《名医》别出艾条，非。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110531-yyznqs1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616110531-yyznqs1"}},{"ID":"20240616110532-6gjec65","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616110532-6gjec65","updated":"20240616110536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白蒿《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240616110532-x8svb93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110532-x8svb93","updated":"20240616110532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生川泽。所在有之。春初最先诸草而生，似青蒿而叶粗，上有白毛。及秋香美可生食，俗名蓬蒿也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110532-qfu73sc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110532-qfu73sc","updated":"20240616110532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，平，无毒。主五脏邪气，风寒湿痹，补中益气，长毛发令黑，疗心悬，少食常饥。久服耳目聪明，轻身不老。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110628-9xto7f1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616110628-9xto7f1"}},{"ID":"20240616110629-gg5zlwq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616110629-gg5zlwq","updated":"20240616110633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白蒿《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240616110629-rvr3mq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110629-rvr3mq8","updated":"20240616110629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．生中山，二月采．"}]},{"ID":"20240616110629-0nsit1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110629-0nsit1s","updated":"20240616110637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶白蒿，味甘，平．主五脏邪气，风寒湿痹，补中益气，长毛发令黑，疗心县，少食，常饥。久服，轻身，耳目聪明，不老。生川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110643-39wsvl2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616110643-39wsvl2"}},{"ID":"20240616110644-jjx53lg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616110644-jjx53lg","updated":"20240616110648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白蒿《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240616110644-nz2gito","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110644-nz2gito","updated":"20240616110644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘平。主五脏邪气。风寒湿痹。补中益气。长毛发令黑。疗心县。少食常饥。久服轻身。耳目聪明。不老。生山泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110644-xeik3ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110644-xeik3ez","updated":"20240616110644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"留青还白。匪莪伊芳蒿。秋瑟瑟。寒水迢迢。蓼零露。荐杂溪毛。吴酸调沦。清羡吾饕。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110644-b88xtmc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110644-b88xtmc","updated":"20240616110644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苏恭曰。白蒿所在有之。粗于青蒿。至秋白于众蒿。武帝内传。还白留青。诗。匪莪伊芳蒿。颜延之诗。秋冬未至。杨炯赋。风萧萧兮瑟瑟。沈约诗。开襟濯寒水。苏轼诗。迢迢涧水随人急。诗。零露兮。左传。涧溪沼之毛。苹蘩蕴藻之菜。可荐于鬼神。大招注。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110644-1s6mroe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110644-1s6mroe","updated":"20240616110644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蒿蒌。吴人善调酸沦为齑。许有孚诗。或羡吾饕是清福。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110706-b5bjawp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616110706-b5bjawp"}},{"ID":"20240616110707-4adp6j3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616110707-4adp6j3","updated":"20240616110713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白蒿《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616110707-3om19u0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110707-3om19u0","updated":"20240616110710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"白蒿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，蓬蒿也。生中山川泽，今所在有之。春初最先诸草而生，似青蒿而叶粗，上有白毛错涩，从初生至枯，白于众蒿，颇似细艾。二月采。此《尔雅》所谓蘩（音烦）皤（音婆）蒿是也。疏云∶蓬蒿，可以为菹。故《诗笺》云∶以豆荐蘩菹。陆机云∶凡艾白色为皤蒿。今白蒿春始生，及秋香美，可生食，又可蒸。一名游胡，北海人谓之旁勃。故《大戴礼夏小正》云∶繁，游胡。游胡，旁勃也。此草古人以为菹。唐·孟诜亦云∶生 醋食。今人但食蒌蒿，不复食此。或疑此蒿即蒌蒿。而孟诜又别着蒌蒿条，所说不同，明是二物，乃知古今食品之异也。又今阶州以白蒿为茵陈蒿，苗叶亦相似，然以入药，恐不可用也。按蒿类亦多。《尔雅》云∶蘩之丑，秋蒿。言春时各有种名，至秋老成，皆通呼为蒿也。中品有马先蒿，云生南阳川泽，叶如益母草，花红白。八、九月有实，俗谓之虎麻，亦名马新蒿。《诗·小雅》所谓匪莪伊芳蔚是也。陆机云∶蔚，牡蒿。牡蒿，牡 （愆刃切）也。三月始生，七月华，似胡麻花而谓无子者。而陆云有子，二说小异。今当用有子者为正。下品又有角蒿，云叶似白蒿，花如瞿麦，红赤可爱，子似王不留行，黑色作角。七、八月采。又有茵陈蒿、草蒿，下自有条。白蒿、马新蒿，古方治癞疾多用之。《深师方》云∶取白艾蒿十束如升大，煮取汁，以曲及米一如酿酒法，候熟稍稍饮之。但是恶疾遍体，面目有疮者，皆可饮之。又取马新蒿捣末，服方寸匕，日三。如更赤起，服之一年，都差平复。角蒿医方鲜有用者。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110654-hp37cwn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616110654-hp37cwn"}},{"ID":"20240616110655-r4xrnlo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616110655-r4xrnlo","updated":"20240616110701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白蒿《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616110655-a1xb125","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110655-a1xb125","updated":"20240616110655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，平，无毒。主五脏邪气，风寒湿痹，补中益气，长毛发令黑，疗心悬，少食常饥。久服轻身，耳目聪明，不老。生中山川泽。二月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110655-bwe9u8f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110655-bwe9u8f","updated":"20240616110655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶蒿类甚多，而俗中不闻呼白蒿者，方药家既不用，皆无复识之，所主疗既殊佳，应更加研访。服食七禽散云∶白兔食之，仙。与前庵 子同法尔。唐本注云∶《尔雅》∶蘩（音烦），皤（音婆）蒿。即白蒿也。此蒿叶粗于青蒿，从初生至枯，白于众蒿，欲似细艾者，所在有之也。今按别本注云∶叶似艾，叶上有白毛粗涩，俗呼为蓬蒿。臣禹锡等谨按尔雅疏云∶蓬蒿可以为菹，故《诗笺》云∶以豆荐蘩菹。陆机云∶凡艾，白色为皤蒿。今白蒿，春始生，及秋香美。可生食又可蒸。一名游胡，北海人谓之旁勃，故《大戴礼·夏小正传》曰∶蘩，游胡。游胡，旁勃也。孟诜云∶白蒿，寒。春初此蒿前诸草生。捣汁去热黄及心痛。其叶生挪，醋淹之为菹，甚益人。又，叶干为末，夏日暴水痢，以米饮和一匙，空腹服之。子，主鬼气，末和酒服之良。又，烧淋灰煎，治淋沥疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110655-egdd8rr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110655-egdd8rr","updated":"20240616110655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶白蒿，蓬蒿也。生中山川泽，今所在有之。春初最先诸草而生，似青蒿而叶粗，上有白毛错涩，从初生至枯，白于众蒿，颇似细艾。二月采。此《尔雅》所谓蘩（音烦），皤（音婆）蒿是也。疏云∶蓬蒿，可以为菹。故《诗笺》云∶以豆荐蘩菹。陆机云∶凡艾，白色为皤蒿。今白蒿，春始生，及秋香美，可生食，又可蒸。一名游胡，北海人谓之旁勃，故《大戴礼·夏小正》云∶蘩，游胡。游胡，旁勃也。此草古人以为菹。唐·孟诜亦云∶生挪醋食。今人但食蒌蒿，不复食此。或疑此蒿即蒌蒿。而孟诜又别着蒌蒿条，所说不同，明是二物，乃知古今食品之异也。又今阶州以白蒿为茵陈蒿，苗、叶亦相似，然以入药，恐不可用也。按蒿类亦多。《尔雅》云∶蘩之丑，秋蒿。言春时各有种名，至秋老成，皆通呼为蒿也。中品有马先蒿，云生南阳川泽，叶如益母草，花红白，八、九月有实，谷谓之虎麻，亦名马新蒿。《诗·小雅》所谓匪莪伊芳蔚是也。陆机云∶蔚，牡蒿。牡蒿，牡 （愆刃切）也。三月始生，七月华，似胡麻花而紫赤，八月为角，角似小豆角，锐而长，一名马新蒿。郭璞注《尔雅》∶蔚，牡 。谓无子者。而陆云有子，二说小异。今当用有子者为正。下品又有角蒿，云叶似白蒿，花如瞿麦，红赤可爱，子似王不留行，黑色作角，七、八月采。又有茵陈蒿、草蒿，下自有条。白蒿、马新蒿，古方治癞疾多用之。《深师方∶》云∶取白艾蒿十束如升大，煮取汁，以曲及米一如酿酒法，候熟，稍稍饮之但是恶疾遍体，面目有疮者，皆可饮之。又取马新蒿捣末，服方寸匕，日三。如更赤起，服之一年，都瘥平复。角蒿，医方鲜有用者。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110558-vb1dgvs","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616110558-vb1dgvs"}},{"ID":"20240616110559-s32hy1f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616110559-s32hy1f","updated":"20240616110603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白蒿《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616110559-dtdc85c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110559-dtdc85c","updated":"20240616110559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，平，无毒。主五脏邪气，风寒湿痹，补中益气，长毛发令黑，疗心悬，少食常饥。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110559-ummlgjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110559-ummlgjk","updated":"20240616110559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"久服轻身，耳目聪明不老。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110559-iallcgt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110559-iallcgt","updated":"20240616110559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生中山川泽，二月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110559-qjutvh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110559-qjutvh9","updated":"20240616110559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蒿类甚多，而俗中不闻呼白蒿者，方药家既不用，皆无复识之，所主疗既殊佳，应更加研访。服食七禽散云∶白兔食之，仙。与前 子同法耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110559-fwl9h7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110559-fwl9h7d","updated":"20240616110559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕《尔雅》∶蘩（音烦），皤（音婆）蒿，即白蒿也。此蒿叶粗于青蒿，从初生至枯，白于众蒿，欲似细艾者，所在有之也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110540-8aulm73","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616110540-8aulm73"}},{"ID":"20240616110541-edwqu8a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616110541-edwqu8a","updated":"20240616110554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白蒿《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240616110541-mzsxolf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110541-mzsxolf","updated":"20240616110541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」由胡、蒌蒿、蘩。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110541-ewy2kvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110541-ewy2kvm","updated":"20240616110541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（苗、根）甘、平、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110541-gfi94n6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110541-gfi94n6","updated":"20240616110541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」风寒湿痹、恶疮癞疾、夏月暴痢等。能杀河豚鱼毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110607-dbvnq8h","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616110607-dbvnq8h"}},{"ID":"20240616110608-qgwolsl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616110608-qgwolsl","updated":"20240616110612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白蒿《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240616110608-4x19e3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110608-4x19e3v","updated":"20240616110608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，平，无毒。主五脏邪气，风寒湿痹，补中益气，长毛发令黑。疗心悬，少食常饥。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110608-l5affju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110608-l5affju","updated":"20240616110608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"久服轻身，耳目聪明不老。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110617-wlpwmz4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616110617-wlpwmz4"}},{"ID":"20240616110618-db9v076","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616110618-db9v076","updated":"20240616110622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白蒿《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240616110618-g1jazw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110618-g1jazw9","updated":"20240616110618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，平，无毒。主治五脏邪气，风寒湿痹，补中益气，长毛发令黑，治心悬，少食常饥。久服轻身，耳目聪明，不老。生中山川泽。二月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110618-w3u7kmv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110618-w3u7kmv","updated":"20240616110618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蒿类甚多，而世中不闻呼白蒿者，方药家既不用，皆无复识之，所主治既殊佳。应更加研访。服食七禽散云∶白兔食之，仙。与前 子同法尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111719-hz89eyq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607111719-hz89eyq"}},{"ID":"20240607111713-ht68uqy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-ht68uqy","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：白蒿"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-myb562y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-myb562y","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-i1roa30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-i1roa30","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Bái Hāo"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-bqh869e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-bqh869e","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-g2y8mxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-g2y8mxn","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蘩（《诗经》），皤蒿（《毛诗传》），由胡、蘩母、旁勃（《夏小正传》），白艾蒿（《僧深集方》），蓬蒿（《开宝本草》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-b2phs2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-b2phs2q","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-4nplhhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-4nplhhd","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-ct2vdgq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-ct2vdgq","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-8hjkc85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-8hjkc85","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为菊科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大籽蒿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全草"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-08hccc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-08hccc9","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-itirrmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-itirrmo","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生长河边、草地、荒地。分布东北、华北及甘肃、陕西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-b6h7ten","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-b6h7ten","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-mjz83rx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-mjz83rx","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 二年生草本，高50～150厘米。茎被白毛，多分枝。单叶耳生；有柄；2～3回羽状深裂或全裂，终裂片宽线形、线形或近披针形，先端常钝，上面绿色，毛较少，下面灰绿色，密生白毛；茎上部的叶羽状分裂或不分裂；近无柄。头状花序半球形，径5～7毫米，有梗，下垂，排成圆锥状花序；总苞片密被白毛，最外列者线形，灰黄绿色；小花皆为管状，黄色，表面有腺点，全部结实，花托有毛，毛几与小花等长。瘦果小，狭长倒卵形，具纵纹，黄褐色，长不及1毫米。花期8～9月。果期9～10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-jertj6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-jertj6x","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-6zt7kz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-6zt7kz2","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本植物的绿色部分含一种倍半萜烯类白蒿宁，地上部分又含白蒿素、洋艾内酯和洋艾素。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-3m77t92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-3m77t92","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干植物含生物碱0.12～0.2％、焦性儿茶酚糅质0.499％、黄酮类0.831％、内酯类，及微量的呋喃香豆精，此外，又含芸香甙、异槲皮甙。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-rnu32ai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-rnu32ai","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-a8mf5pg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-a8mf5pg","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 从其中分出的倍半萜r-内酯，对金黄色薄萄球菌、大肠杆菌等在体外有抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-yu7gybf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-yu7gybf","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-g01u7pf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-g01u7pf","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-t70ys45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-t70ys45","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味甘，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-0j2jgo1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-0j2jgo1","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-7mznsn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-7mznsn0","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《千金·食治》：\"味苦辛，平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-w5tx4p8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-w5tx4p8","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④孟诜：\"寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-odalbgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-odalbgp","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-up3159m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-up3159m","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治风寒湿痹，黄疸，热痢，疥癞恶疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-1gnsn97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-1gnsn97","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主五藏邪气，风寒湿痹，补中益气，长毛发令黑。疗心悬少食常饥。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-dpnbs5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-dpnbs5t","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②孟诜：\"捣汁去热黄及心痛。叶干为末，夏日暴水痢，以米饮和一匙，空腹服之。又烧灰淋煎治淋沥疾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-cyxtzrg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-cyxtzrg","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-zdz6q1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-zdz6q1d","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，或捣汁。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-uyn3mbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-uyn3mbf","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-tnxhswm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-tnxhswm","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治恶癞疾，遍体面目有疮者：白艾蒿十束如升大，煮取汁，以曲及米，一如酿酒法，候熟稍稍饮之。（《僧深集方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-1a70jxt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-1a70jxt","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-uz8vd64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-uz8vd64","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗急性细菌性痢疾"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":":取白蒿鲜草2两或干品1两，水煎。分2～3次服，每日1剂，5～7日为一疗程；或制成冲剂及片剂服用。共治100例，显效（3天内达临床治愈）70例，有效（4～7天内达临床治愈）23例，治愈率为93％。据部分病例观察，服药后体温恢复正常平均1.35天，便次恢复正常2.12天，腹痛消失1.55天，里急后重消失1.68天；大便镜检恢复正常及细菌转阴平均时间分别为3.02天和5.65天。疗效似较黄连、痢特灵、合霉素等为高。冲剂、片剂疗效似较煎剂为差。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-s7z3qhj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-s7z3qhj","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-8fklhxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-8fklhxj","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-5wnd5bi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-5wnd5bi","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：白蒿"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-65da4ju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-65da4ju","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-aycsdfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-aycsdfm","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Bái Hāo"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-bqysac9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-bqysac9","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-py3pq0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-py3pq0s","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蘩、皤蒿、由胡、莓母、旁勃、白艾蒿、蓬蒿、大白蒿、大子蒿、臭蒿子、山艾、大头蒿、苦蒿"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-blsbbcy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-blsbbcy","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-sjkt4tg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-sjkt4tg","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Herb of Sievers Wormwood"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-1clovrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-1clovrj","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-avkyfnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-avkyfnw","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自1.《本经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-lrccx2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-lrccx2o","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《唐本草》：白蒿，此蒿叶粗于青蒿，从初生至枯，白于众蒿，欲似细艾者。所在有之也。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-1p9kpuf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-1p9kpuf","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.孟诜：春初，此蒿（白蒿）前诸草生，其叶生挼醋淹之为葅，甚益人。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-r1f3gj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-r1f3gj6","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《开宝本草》：别本注云，（白蒿）叶似艾叶，上有白毛，粗涩，俗呼为蓬蒿。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-gsa1die","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-gsa1die","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草图经》：此草（白蒿），古人以为葅，唐孟诜亦云生挼醋食，今人但食蒌蒿，不复食此，或疑此蒿即蒌蒿，而孟诜又别着蒌蒿条，所"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-hmdutro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-hmdutro","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-hjkqztk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-hjkqztk","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为菊科植物大籽蒿的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-rlzmx6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-rlzmx6p","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Arteimiaisia sieuersiana Ehrhart ex Willd. [A.maxa DC.; A. korana Nakai; A.chrysolepis Kitag.; Ab-sinthium sieuersianun Bess.]"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-mqav5mr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-mqav5mr","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏、秋间开期采收，鲜用或扎把晾干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-wsxahgk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-wsxahgk","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-7dadz3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-7dadz3l","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于海拔500-4200m的路旁、荒地、河滩、草原、干山坡或林缘等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-yss24m0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-yss24m0","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于东北、华北、西北、西南及西藏等地。山东、江苏等地有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-acf4ime","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-acf4ime","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-eldijkj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-eldijkj","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 大籽蒿 一二年生草本，高50-150cm。主根单一，狭纺锤形。茎下部稍木质化，纵棱明显，多分枝，茎、枝被类白色微柔毛。叶互生；叶柄长1-4cm；下部与中部叶宽卵形或宽卵圆表，长4-8cm，宽3-6cm，二至三回羽状全裂，每侧有裂片2-3枚，裂片常再成不规则的则羽状全裂或深裂，小裂片线形或线状披针形，长2-10mm，宽1-2mm，先端钝或渐尖，基部有小型羽状分裂的假托叶；上部叶及苞片叶羽状全裂或一分裂，椭圆状披针形或披针形，无柄。头状花序，多数，半球形或近球形，直径3-6mm，具短梗，基部常有线形的小苞地，在分枝上排成总状或复总状花序，总苞3-4层，外层、中层背面被灰白色微柔毛或近无毛，中肋绿色，边缘狭膜质，内层膜质；花序托半球形，具白色托毛；雄花2（-3）层，20-30朵，花冠檐部具2-4裂齿，花柱线形，先端2叉；两性花多层，80-120朵，花冠管状，花药上端附属物尖，长三角形，基部有短尖头，花柱与花冠等长，先端叉形，叉端截形，有睫毛。瘦果长圆形。花、果期6-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-7l3huml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-7l3huml","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-lfcfj9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-lfcfj9p","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 茎类圆柱形，长短一一，直径可达5mm。绿色，表面有纵棱，可见互生的枝、叶或叶基。上部有较密的柔毛。质坚脆，易折断，断面纤维性，中央有白色髓。叶皱缩或已破碎，完整叶片展平后二至三回羽状深裂，裂片线形，两面均被柔毛。头状花序较多，半球形，直径3-6mm，总花梗细瘦，总苞叶线形，总苞片2-3列，边缘有白色宽膜片，背面被短柔毛；花托卵形；边缘为雌花，内层花两性，均为管状。成熟花序可见倒卵形的瘦果。气浓香，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-ketu0eb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-ketu0eb","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 茎横切面：多边形。表皮一列细胞，外被丁字毛，细胞多径向，较长。内皮层凯氏点明显。维管束鞘纤维壁厚木化。韧皮部较宽。形成层不明显。维管束排列成环，导管多边形，2-12个成群，排列成单列。木纤维分布面积大，细胞壁厚化。射线单列，胞腔内有内含物。树脂道散生髓部。髓大，周边的细胞壁厚化。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-nmo1666","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-nmo1666","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶横切面：上、下表皮细胞各1列，外被角质层；赤见多数丁字毛或其残基；上、下表皮均有气孔，但以下表皮较多。栅栏组织1-2列细胞，海绵组织数列细胞。主脉处表皮下具厚角组织。主脉维管束常为1束。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-c81r4ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-c81r4ck","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"树脂道散生在栅栏组织。粉末特征：灰白色。①非腺毛甚多，多丁字形，长3-5mm，无色，表面光滑，胞壁微厚。②纤维多碎断，成束或单个散在，直径9-36μm，胞壁厚略弯曲，腔狭，纹孔稀少或缺。③导管少见，以网纹导管为主，赤有螺纹、梯纹和具缘纹孔，直径12-35μm。④结晶甚多，单个，形状不一，大小为23-92μm，不溶于盐酸。⑤薄壁细胞多数，四边形，多边形或类圆形，无色，有少数纹孔。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-2btfh7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-2btfh7p","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-z49zgm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-z49zgm5","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 地上部分含一第列的倍半萜类衍生物，内有：白蒿素（sieversin），4-羟基-8-乙酰氧基-8-乙酰氧基-1（2），9（10）-愈创木二烯-6，12-内酯[4-hydroxy-8-acetoxyguaia-1(2),9(10)-dien-6,12-olede][1]，洋艾内酯（artabsin），洋艾内酯（artabsin），洋艾素（sbsinthin）[2]，白蒿宁（siev-ersinin）[3]，11-表洋艾素（11-epiabsinthin），11，10，11-表洋艾素（11，10，11-epiabsinthin），10，11-表洋艾素（10，11-epiab-sinthin），大籽蒿素（artesiversin），11α-二氢墨西哥蒿素B（2β-hydroxy-8-desoxy-11α，13-dihydroxrupicolin B）,11α，13-二氢汉菲林[11α，13-dihydro-4(2)-hanphyllin]，异戊酸，-（8-异戊酰氧基）橙花醇酯（8-isovaleryoxy-nerylisovalerate），2α，3α-环氧-11α，13-二氢去氢木香内酯（2α，13-dihydrodeth-drocostrslactone），大牻牛儿烯（dermacetene）D，右旋姜黄烯（cur-cumene），异戊酸橙花醇酯（nerylisovalerate），4-去羟亚菊素（4-de-hydroxyajadin，ludartin），安洋艾素（anabsinthin）[4]，球花母菊素（globicin）[5]，兰香油薁（chamazulene），兰香油精（chamazuleno-gen）[6]，蒿萜内酯（artemolin）[7]等。还含木脂体类分合物：芝麻素（sesamin），e，a-阿斯汉亭（e，a-ashantin），e，e-蒿脂麻木质体（e，e-sesartemin），鹅掌楸树脂醇B二甲醚（yangambin，O，O-dimethyllirioresinol B），鹅掌楸树脂醇A二甲醚（epiyangambin，O，O-dimethyllirioresinol A）[4]。又含黄酮类化合物：艾黄素（artemisetin），猎眼草黄素（chrysosplenetin）[8]，芸香甙（rutin），异槲皮甙（isoquercetrin）[9]以及马栗树皮素（esculetin），咖啡酸（caf-feic acid）[8]和具有抗炎作用的精油（essential oil）[10]等。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-d3mllj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-d3mllj7","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-rnnxfuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-rnnxfuy","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 从其中分出的倍半萜γ-内酯，对金黄色葡萄球菌、大肠杆菌等在体外有抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-4p1lpu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-4p1lpu4","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-yt66ut7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-yt66ut7","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味苦；微甘；性凉"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-98reneb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-98reneb","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-rt88qe3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-rt88qe3","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热利湿；凉血止血。主肿热咳嗽；咽喉肿痛；湿热黄疸；热痢；淋病；风湿痹痛；吐血；咯血；外伤出血；疥瘌恶疮"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-lk2u3tz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-lk2u3tz","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-hcb041v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-hcb041v","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，10-15g，鲜品加倍；或捣汁；或研末。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-m562zxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-m562zxw","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-3ywqd9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-3ywqd9i","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主五藏邪气，风寒湿痹，补中益气，长毛发令黑，疗心悬少食常饥。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-vzlyzz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-vzlyzz7","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.孟诜：捣汁去热黄及心痛。叶干为末，夏日暴水痢，以米饮和一匙，空腹服之。又烧灰淋煎治淋沥疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-npu9xjy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-npu9xjy","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607111713-jzau7pf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111713-jzau7pf","updated":"20240607111713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607111715-vp4t0ds","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607111715-vp4t0ds"}},{"ID":"20240607111716-2zmwrb0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111716-2zmwrb0"}}]}